{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急になりますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日12月14日深夜25:00から\nANNに出演させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/14/2707976/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"94年組のみんなで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな近々に\nまたANNに出演できて嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/14/2707976/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も\n24時からはSHOWROOMで\n生配信もやっちゃいますよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://www.showroom-live.com/pre_allnightnippon"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてね！\n観てね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうとっくに発売されてるので\nもう買ったよ！って方も多いと思いますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『MARQUEE』 に\n蘭世と載ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"乃木坂\"として\nというよりは\n\"サンエト\"として\n載ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装もね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/14/2707976/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、チェックしてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/14/2707976/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週の沈金についても\nまだ書いてなかった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストはDISH//さんでした！\nめっちゃ賑やかで面白かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださってありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/14/2707976/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館終わりにギリギリに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というかギリギリというよりは\n遅れてるんですけども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かけつけました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも想定よりも\nめっちゃ早く到着したよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/14/2707976/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田みたいに武道館終わりに\nかけつけてくださる人がたくさんいたから\nいつもよりも\nたくさんの方が観覧に来てくれて\n嬉しかったよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな\n聴いてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/14/2707976/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然ブログ更新できてなかったせいで\n書きたいことがたまってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/14/2707976/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなってごめんね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/14/2707976/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メもこんなオフのしか\nありませんでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリン作った時の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}